# Board patch paths, one per line in application order.
# The zzyd/zzye/zzyf patches are sheng (SM8550) audio, idle and AMP changes
# and are not applied on dizi.
# Bring-up: accept the unauthenticated read-only UFS root with native-ufs-allow-unverified=1.
dizi-ufs-unverified-root.patch
# Boot-progress page and text console with -v (from the ruan port).
dizi-boot-progress.patch
# dyld_flags=8 skips libignition; PID 1 syscalls on the boot-progress page (from the ruan port).
dizi-pid1-dyld.patch
# Mount the SystemOS volume as a read-only union over the root before launchd (dyld shared cache).
dizi-systemos-union.patch
# Writable Data volume: NativeRamBlock serves the payload Data seed, mounted on /private/var (data-uuid=<UUID>).
dizi-data-volume.patch
# DRAM outside DarwinBoot's window becomes VM memory (ruan-memory-outside.patch from the ruan port, unchanged); opt-in with memory-outside=N.
dizi-memory-outside.patch
# AppleKeyStore stand-in before launchd (aks=1 offline-key-events=1), from the ruan port.
dizi-keystore-probe.patch
